            type: "p",
            html: "When building a mobile app, your tech stack is the foundation. It determines how fast your app performs, how scalable it is, how secure it will be, and how smoothly it integrates with other tools or platforms. Yet, many startups and businesses dive into development without carefully considering which technologies are right for their product and goals."
